# Product

ymaps has two constraints: the optimal route, and the fastest time to get it. Read `docs/product.md`.

Ship a change only when it improves the route or shortens the time to receive it. Drop everything else.

Route decisions, alias resolution, shuttle prediction, and rerouting belong on the server. The client collects the destination and presents the route.

Any model, speech, ranking, or generated language uses a Grok product.
